ition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Encumbered\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Encumbered_(Condition)\" title=\"Encumbered (Condition)\">Encumbered</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Encumbered_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Encumbered (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavily Encumbered\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Encumbered_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Encumbered (Condition)\">Heavily Encumbered</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715040952\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 562/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5974/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 942/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand siz